                                "example_id": "2e25faea-cd75-49bc-a272-f2c3313cb3b1",
                                "sense_id": "986df283-cffc-301f-8a7f-ad86947889e5",
                                "text": "Thus, if one confines another, even a prisoner, who has not had the small-pox, with an infected person, whereby the one confined takes the distemper and dies, he is chargeable with murder."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
