                                "text": "1853 The Speeches of the Right Honourable Charles James Fox in the House of Common\nThese cruelties are not, indeed, chargeable on Mr. Hastings personally; but when I state, that he levied an unjust war, the consequences that follow he is guilty of."
                            }
